{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ProductionOrders\">Production Orders</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business Businesses Is On Orders ProductionOrder ProductionOrders To ToDate\">The <strong>Production Orders</strong> tab is designed for manufacturing businesses. It enables them to oversee and track their production processes, managing the transformation of raw materials into finished goods.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-conveyor-belt text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ProductionOrders\">Production Orders</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create NewProductionOrder On ProductionOrder To ToDate\">To create a new production order, click the <strong>New Production Order</strong> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ProductionOrders\">Production Orders</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewProductionOrder\">New Production Order</span></span></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Columns On Orders ProductionOrder ProductionOrders\">The <strong>Production Orders</strong> tab includes several columns:</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Date On ProductionOrder\">The date when the production order was created or executed.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is On ProductionOrder Reference\">A unique reference number that identifies this production order.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Description Is Notes On ProductionOrder\">A description of what is being produced or any notes about this production order.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryLocation\">Inventory Location</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryLocation\">Inventory Location</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"HasWhere InventoryLocation Is Location On To ToDate\">The <em>inventory location</em> where the finished goods will be stored after production.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FinishedInventoryItem\">Finished item</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FinishedInventoryItem\">Finished item</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem Is Item On ProductionOrder To ToDate\">The <em>inventory item</em> that will be produced as a result of this production order.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Qty\">Qty</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Qty\">Qty</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Is On ProductionOrder To ToDate\">The quantity of finished goods to be produced by this production order.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TotalCost\">Total cost</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TotalCost\">Total cost</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is To ToDate Total TotalCost\">The total cost of producing the finished goods, including all raw materials and allocated costs.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Status\">Status</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Status\">Status</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Complete On ProductionOrder\">Shows whether the production order has been successfully completed.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And BillOfMaterials From FromDate InventoryItem InventoryItems Item On Required Status To ToDate\">A status of <strong>Complete</strong> means all required inventory items from the <em>bill of materials</em> were available and allocated.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On Required Status\">A status of <strong>Insufficient Quantity</strong> indicates that some required materials were not available in sufficient quantities.</p></div></details>",
